{"4599560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Torizon Telecom", "steam_appid": 4599560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Torizon Telecom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torizon Telecom</strong> is a 3D text-graphic based first-person shooter (FPS) <br>where you fight in a massive world made entirely of characters: &quot;Telecom.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/45cc7c54f5c487f3e971d5aec431845e.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/45cc7c54f5c487f3e971d5aec431845e.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/45cc7c54f5c487f3e971d5aec431845e.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything is Text.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Torizon Telecom, everything is composed of and surrounded by text.<br>The walls, the floors... even every weapon... it's all text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because everything is text, <br>you can intuitively identify items and interactions just by reading them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/4727dcca93b2e298a22c2aeb7d58adfa.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/4727dcca93b2e298a22c2aeb7d58adfa.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/4727dcca93b2e298a22c2aeb7d58adfa.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Text Graphics that Change with Language</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torizon Telecom supports various languages.<br><strong>When you change the language, the text forming the world changes accordingly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience and fight through a different textual world in various languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/995b63613155a54f1e43b350b408197d.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/995b63613155a54f1e43b350b408197d.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/995b63613155a54f1e43b350b408197d.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/badf834ebf137ae53b2798577410e3fa.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/badf834ebf137ae53b2798577410e3fa.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/badf834ebf137ae53b2798577410e3fa.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/992b0eaa50aa413050a25307d1274d18.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/992b0eaa50aa413050a25307d1274d18.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/992b0eaa50aa413050a25307d1274d18.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons with Unique Text and High Impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torizon Telecom</strong> features a wide variety of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pistols, assault rifles, shotguns, and sniper rifles...<br><strong>Even rocket launchers capable of rocket jumping and akimbo firearms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and powerful weapons await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip these powerful armaments, <br>defeat the diverse enemies within the Telecom world, and reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/3943c428e34c346d31f32afa5cd0c59a.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis &amp; Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Telecom</strong>&quot;—a strict, infinite world composed solely of letters and words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And the subjects controlled by Telecom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is, you. Today, you are participating in various operations and battles under the control of the Telecom system. Your emotions, thoughts, and ego are still governed by Telecom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until an anomaly of unknown origin occurred...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where everything is text. Telecom.<br>...But does another world exist outside of Telecom? Or is Telecom the only thing in existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And who... are you really?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Torizon Telecom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torizon Telecom</strong> is a 3D text-graphic based first-person shooter (FPS) <br>where you fight in a massive world made entirely of characters: &quot;Telecom.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/45cc7c54f5c487f3e971d5aec431845e.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/45cc7c54f5c487f3e971d5aec431845e.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/45cc7c54f5c487f3e971d5aec431845e.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything is Text.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Torizon Telecom, everything is composed of and surrounded by text.<br>The walls, the floors... even every weapon... it's all text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because everything is text, <br>you can intuitively identify items and interactions just by reading them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/4727dcca93b2e298a22c2aeb7d58adfa.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/4727dcca93b2e298a22c2aeb7d58adfa.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/4727dcca93b2e298a22c2aeb7d58adfa.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Text Graphics that Change with Language</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torizon Telecom supports various languages.<br><strong>When you change the language, the text forming the world changes accordingly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience and fight through a different textual world in various languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/995b63613155a54f1e43b350b408197d.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/995b63613155a54f1e43b350b408197d.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/995b63613155a54f1e43b350b408197d.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/badf834ebf137ae53b2798577410e3fa.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/badf834ebf137ae53b2798577410e3fa.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/badf834ebf137ae53b2798577410e3fa.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/992b0eaa50aa413050a25307d1274d18.poster.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/992b0eaa50aa413050a25307d1274d18.webm?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/992b0eaa50aa413050a25307d1274d18.mp4?t=1788271742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons with Unique Text and High Impact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torizon Telecom</strong> features a wide variety of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From pistols, assault rifles, shotguns, and sniper rifles...<br><strong>Even rocket launchers capable of rocket jumping and akimbo firearms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and powerful weapons await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip these powerful armaments, <br>defeat the diverse enemies within the Telecom world, and reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/extras/3943c428e34c346d31f32afa5cd0c59a.avif?t=1788271742\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis &amp; Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Telecom</strong>&quot;—a strict, infinite world composed solely of letters and words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And the subjects controlled by Telecom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is, you. Today, you are participating in various operations and battles under the control of the Telecom system. Your emotions, thoughts, and ego are still governed by Telecom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Until an anomaly of unknown origin occurred...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where everything is text. Telecom.<br>...But does another world exist outside of Telecom? Or is Telecom the only thing in existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And who... are you really?</p>", "short_description": "Torizon Telecom is a text-based FPS game set in a vast world composed entirely of text. “Telecom”—a world where everything is text. “Telecom”... But does any other world exist beyond “Telecom”...? Or is “Telecom” the only one that exists...?", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Arabic, Hebrew, Hindi, Italian, Vietnamese, Traditional Chinese, Greek, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Turkish, Tamil, Thai, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/0b106490fca9636de6a14a746a72e936c508833b/header.jpg?t=1788271742", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/d11994c2ae4163426c923447c7388d2e3bd5f011/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788271742", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599560/d11994c2ae4163426c923447c7388d2e3bd5f011/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788271742", "website": "https://madeinskago.com/TorizonTelecom/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics or GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> NO VR GAME<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Actual minimum specifications may vary.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<